</sect2></sect1>
<sect1 id="chapter5_1autotoc_md127_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter5_1autotoc_md127">
<title>Compatibility-first flow</title><para>On construction, adapter queries <computeroutput><ref refid="Sattyre-Solver_8h_1aeff6222bf8eea217cfb5aaed90c9a199" kindref="member">sattyre_solver_info</ref></computeroutput> and verifies ABI compatibility. If incompatible, fail early with a clear exception. Solver creation and destruction should follow RAII semantics.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">sattyre::NativeSolverAdapter<sp/>solver;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">sattyre::SATProblem<sp/>p<sp/>=<sp/>sattyre::parse_dimacs_file(&quot;examples/example.cnf&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">solver.load(p);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">sattyre::SolveResult<sp/>r<sp/>=<sp/>solver.solve();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
