<sect1 id="chapter5_1autotoc_md131_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter5_1autotoc_md131">
<title>Model extraction</title><para>Model assignments should correspond to <computeroutput>variable_count</computeroutput>. Unknown result may return empty model by design. Do not expose inconsistent assignment vector lengths.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>The<sp/>model<sp/>must<sp/>not<sp/>exceed<sp/>the<sp/>declared<sp/>number<sp/>of<sp/>variables.</highlight></codeline>
